{
  "scope": "Independent read-only code/source inventory and feature probes, not a duplicate whole-database scanner. No EDB changes or shared extractor edits.",
  "date": "2026-11-13",
  "main_findings": [
    "General font-variant loss is historical: all three principal extractors gained mathvariant preservation in c6245fef763 on 2026-10-27. Old persisted imports do not automatically acquire that fix.",
    "Color preservation was added in stages: legacy scripts/question_capture/dom.js at 3fa511ed17e (2026-10-13); capture/scripts/browser/extract.js and historical Python renderer at 81b8659bc63 (2026-10-27).",
    "Authored mspace dimensions are still lost in all principal extractors: every width, including zero, negative, 1em and 2em, becomes thin space \\, without any reported extraction error.",
    "Existing remaining-instruction reconciliation selects structural lossy_features and omits mathvariant, mathcolor and mspace. A prior broad repair can therefore leave precisely these presentation-only failures untouched."
  ],
