    },
    {
      "root": "reference/mathacademy/capture-database",
      "formats": [
        "batches/*/content-objects/*/*.json.gz",
        "manifest.json content_ref/content_sha256",
        "objects/ immutable evidence"
      ],
      "notes": "Snapshots are historical imported content and provenance, not automatically original HTML. Follow source references; decompress where needed and verify SHA256."
    },
    {
      "root": "reference/mathacademy/{capture-audits,diagnostic-capture,repairs}",
      "formats": [
        "original HTML/JSON and source copies"
      ],
      "notes": "Supplemental evidence; avoid counting generated repair outputs or fixtures as independent originals."
    }
  ],
  "coverage_challenges": [
    "Millions of files include duplicates, assets, screenshots and backups. Count distinct database entities/components with usable source, not file hits or raw regex matches.",
    "Current content.json may have been repaired after import; immutable archived snapshots and exact original HTML matter when determining historical failure timing.",
    "A question can have several source captures and different prompt/history layouts. Resolve MA ID, owning component and source chronology; report conflicting or unsupported captures explicitly.",
    "Read .previous.gz backups or *.json.gz archives only where needed; compressed sources are invisible to plain rg. Primary outputs should distinguish complete, partially sourced and unsourced entities.",
    "MathJax has both visible CHTML/SVG and hidden assistive MathML; select one owned representation, not duplicated descendants/dropdown choice MathML.",
    "Textual color is not rendered RGB: ui/math-content.css intentionally maps light-theme source red to #c00000. Accept theme-preserving colors rather than flagging this as source loss.",
    "Spacing in table columnspacing/rowspacing, mo lspace/rspace, mpadded and phantom geometry is outside an mspace-only sweep; CSS/inherited fonts, SVG-only originals and images need separate review."
  ],
